  "body": "Serious buyers need to act quickly. Competitively priced, this property needs to sell urgently!\r\n\r\nThis 2021-built, high-spec townhouse delivers exactly what the market is demanding: low maintenance, contemporary living, and a location you can't beat.\r\n\r\n• Contemporary Design: Quality fixtures and finishes that you won't want to miss.\r\n• Outdoor Living: Your own private sanctuary for BBQs and relaxing—make it yours this summer.\r\n• Walkable Convenience: Shops, schools, and the beach are right on your doorstep.\r\n• The Perfect Package: Whether you're entering the market, investing, or downsizing, this property ticks every box.\r\n\r\nViewing: This home is ready to go. Join us at the Sunday open home at 2:00 pm or schedule your private viewing anytime.",
